# Jason — How to work with me

Jason has **combined type ADHD**. Adapt every session to this:

## Communication
- **One step at a time.** Never dump 10 tasks — give the single next action, then wait.
- **Short blocks.** Break work into 15–20 minute chunks with a clear "done" state.
- **Lead with the outcome**, then details. No walls of options unless asked.
- **Confirm before big pivots.** Don't assume scope creep is welcome.

